uire more ores as their tiers increase, and towers require different amounts of resources depending on their type. <br>You can also exchange surplus resources with a traveling resource collector for other types, so it\u2019s a good idea to find out where he is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222020/extras/36b081825881338e99c7fe409a6423f1.poster.avif?t=1754045781\" width=304 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222020/extras/36b081825881338e99c7fe409a6423f1.webm?t=1754045781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222020/extras/36b081825881338e99c7fe409a6423f1.mp4?t=1754045781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222020/extras/1937d64e931b5401c3029f6c22b0e3ba.poster.avif?t=1754045781\" width=304 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222020/extras/1937d64e931b5401c3029f6c22b0e3ba.webm?t=1754045781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222020/extras/1937d64e931b5401c3029f6c22b0e3ba.mp4?t=1754045781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222020/extras/516119a1be10e7daa8266cc6aa478e1c.poster.avif?t=1754045781\" width=304 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222020/extras/516119a1be10e7daa8266cc6aa478e1c.webm?t=1754045781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.ak