s themselves to gain experience. <br>Each hero will acquire a unique skill once their experience is fully accumulated, and as they gain more skills, they become uncontrollably stronger, so it's advantageous for you to deal with them as quickly as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222020/extras/3a47088dc2415513e8f4ddd08eff26b0.poster.avif?t=1754045781\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222020/extras/3a47088dc2415513e8f4ddd08eff26b0.webm?t=1754045781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222020/extras/3a47088dc2415513e8f4ddd08eff26b0.mp4?t=1754045781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use various items efficiently.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The different items you can obtain from treasure chests and stage rewards will be very helpful on your journey.<br>Items can be broadly categorized into consumables and equipment. <br>Consumables include various potions that can restore health, cure status ailments, and provide beneficial effects. Additionally, there are various traps that can be used to deal damage to enemies. <br>Equipment items provide passive means of attack and grant the player an advantage through special abilities from unique equipment items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222020/extras/6706e542ea9c427f5053d11d1f2e30b2.poster.avif?t=1754045781\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222020/extras/6706e542ea9c427f5053d11d1f2e30b2.webm?t=1754045781\" 